{"product_id":"numbers-2-the-chaos","title":"Numbers 2 : The Chaos","description":"\u003cp\u003eLike his mother, Jem, when he looks in people's eyes, Adam can see the dates of their deaths. It's hard enough living with this terrible gift, but life is about to get tougher. Adam sees that everyone around him has the same date - January 2027. Something huge is going to happen. Something bad. But what is it? And what can he do about it?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 194 x 128\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Rachel Ward\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781906427306\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 352\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45499425357977,"sku":"6RC9781906427306","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/685bc8c28cfa8_Numbers_2_-_The_Chaos_Rachel_Ward.jpg?v=1751025429","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/numbers-2-the-chaos","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}